<html>
  <body>
    <h1>Bizzlo SOP &amp; LOR Template Bank</h1>
    <h2>Statement of Purpose Structure</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Academic background and motivation.</li>
      <li>Course fit and university fit.</li>
      <li>Career outcome and return plan.</li>
      <li>Financial readiness and genuine student intent.</li>
    </ol>
    <h2>LOR Structure</h2>
    <ol>
      <li>Relationship with student.</li>
      <li>Academic or professional strengths.</li>
      <li>Specific project or performance examples.</li>
      <li>Recommendation for the selected programme.</li>
    </ol>
  </body>
</html>
